@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Pengguna as User
boundary HalamanPencarianUI as PencarianUI
control PencarianController as Controller
entity KontenProvider as Konten

== Main Flow ==

User -> PencarianUI : 1: Masukkan keyword di search bar atau buka halaman pencarian
activate PencarianUI
PencarianUI --> User : 1.1: Tampilkan halaman pencarian

User -> PencarianUI : 2: Masukkan keyword
User -> PencarianUI : 3: Klik tombol Cari atau tekan Enter
PencarianUI -> Controller : 3.1: cariKonten(keyword)
activate Controller
Controller -> Konten : 3.1.1: cariArtikelDanMember(keyword)
activate Konten

alt [Ada hasil]
    Konten --> Controller : 3.1.2: Hasil pencarian (artikel dan member)
    Controller --> PencarianUI : 3.1.3: Data hasil pencarian
    PencarianUI --> User : 3.1.4: Tampilkan hasil pencarian\ndengan filter All, Articles, Members
else [Tidak ada hasil]
    Konten --> Controller : 3.1.2a: Tidak ada hasil
    Controller --> PencarianUI : 3.1.3a: Tidak ada data
    PencarianUI --> User : 3.1.4a: Pesan "Tidak ada hasil"
end

deactivate Konten
deactivate Controller
deactivate PencarianUI

@enduml
